spans.s:
1. न्य्-√ अञ्च् P. -अञ्चति, to sink, bend or hang down, Bālar.; Kathās.;
to pass away, fade, perish, Bhām. :
Caus. -अञ्चयति, to press down or in HPariś.

न्य्-√ अस् P. -अस्यति, or -असति, to throw or cast or lay or put down (with loc., e.g. भुवि, on the earth), AV. &c. &c.;
to take off, MBh.; R.;
to give up, resign (as life), R.;
to set in the ground, plant (प्ररोहान्, shoots), Bālar.;
 (with loc.) to throw or hurl upon, pour or shed on or in, put or place or fix or insert in, turn or direct to, deposit with, intrust or commit to;
to settle arrange, MBh.; Kāv. &c. (with चित्रे, ‘to place in a picture’, paint, depict; with शिरसि, ‘to place on the head’, receive with reverence; with मनसि, ‘to call to mind’, reflect, ponder; with पथि, ‘to lay on the road’, give up);
to bring forward, mention, Mall. :
Caus. (pf. न्यासयाम् आस or ˚सयां चक्रे) to cause to put or lay down, MBh.
